+end on that message, however it was kept (`…`, `…-waited`, `…-quiet`), or
+another chat's agent's Stop; each end is held in a row of its own (`held`
+names its `group`) until the group's last is in, and then they all go as one
+wake. A failure, a question and another chat's agent's Stop still go at once
