+member's follow-up. A member leaves when it's deleted, or the parent stops it
+or sends it something new; the person's Stop keeps it in. If the first end held
+has waited 30 minutes, the ends so far go, with a note saying who it still waits
+on, and the group is over: the rest report one by one. So is one whose child
+another chat took on (a handoff, an adoption), or one a restart cut off while
+its `create_chats` was still making chats; each child made reports on its own.
